{"id": "17-2906-2-11", "zh": "在不定过去时（ajjatanī）语尾之前，vaca 这个词根的 a 音变为 o。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2906-12-15", "zh": "avoci，avocuṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2906-16-19", "zh": "avoco，avocuttha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2906-20-26", "zh": "avociṃ，avocumha，这里增加 u 音。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2906-27-33", "zh": "avoca，元音变短；avocu，等等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2906-34-35", "zh": "avuccittha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2907-2-32", "zh": "在未来时（bhavissantī）中，依“带词缀”一语的摄取，ssa 替换为 kha；在“byañjanantassa”续行的情况下，依“ko khe ca”一条，词根末音替换为 k：vakkhati，vakkhanti。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-2907-33-36", "zh": "vakkhasi，vakkhatha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2907-37-41", "zh": "vakkhāmi，vakkhāma，等等。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2908-2-8", "zh": "vasa，意为居住：vasati，vasanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2909-2-11", "zh": "在被动语态中，变为 u，并同化为前音：vussati，vussanti，等等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2909-12-13", "zh": "vasatu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2909-14-15", "zh": "vaseyya。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2909-16-19", "zh": "avasi，vasi。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2910-2-16", "zh": "在未来时中，ssa 替换为 cha，词根末音变为 c：vacchati，vacchanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2910-17-20", "zh": "vacchasi，vacchatha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2910-21-24", "zh": "vacchāmi，vacchāma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2910-25-28", "zh": "vasissati，vasissanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2910-29-32", "zh": "avasissa，avasissaṃsu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2911-2-9", "zh": "同样，ruda，意为流泪：rodati，rucchati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2911-10-12", "zh": "rodissati，等等。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2912-2-12", "zh": "kusa，意为辱骂：前加 ā，辅音重叠、元音变短，并加 a 词缀、元音增强。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-2912-13-14", "zh": "akkosati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2912-15-16", "zh": "akkosatu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2912-17-18", "zh": "akkoseyya。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2913-2-18", "zh": "“antalopo”一语续行，“vā”一语也以蛙跳的方式续行。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2914-2-8", "zh": "480. 在 kusa 之后，ī 变为 cchi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2915-2-13", "zh": "在 kusa 这个词根之后，ī 语尾替换为 cchi，并删去词根末音。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2915-14-19", "zh": "akkocchi maṃ（他辱骂了我），或者 akkosi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2915-20-21", "zh": "akkosissati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2915-22-24", "zh": "akkosissa，等等。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2916-2-9", "zh": "vaha，意为到达：vahati，vahanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2917-2-9", "zh": "在被动语态的反射态（attanopada）中，加上 ya 词缀之后——", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2918-2-9", "zh": "“ye”一语续行。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2919-2-9", "zh": "481. ha 音换位，或变为 l。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2920-2-17", "zh": "在 ya 词缀之后，ha 音换位，ya 词缀也可以变为 l 音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2920-18-47", "zh": "这里的 vā 一词表示限定性的选择（vavatthitavibhāsā），因此在“gayhati”等处不变为 l；变为 l 的只是作为条件的 ya 音；依“vacavasa”等一条，变为 u。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-2920-48-54", "zh": "vuyhati，vulhati，vuyhanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2920-55-58", "zh": "vahatu，vuyhatu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2920-59-62", "zh": "vaheyya，vuyheyya。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2920-63-68", "zh": "avahī，avuyhittha，avahittha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2920-69-72", "zh": "avahissati，vuyhissati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2920-73-77", "zh": "avahissa，avuyhissa，等等。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2921-2-4", "zh": "jara，意为年岁衰老。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2922-2-8", "zh": "482. jara、mara 可替换为 jīra、jīyya、mīyya。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2923-2-11", "zh": "jara、mara 这两个词根可替换为 jīra、jīyya、mīyya，并有元音删除等变化。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2923-12-15", "zh": "jīrati，jīranti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2923-16-19", "zh": "jīyyati，jīyyanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2923-20-30", "zh": "依“kvaci”等一条，两个 ya 音中的一个有时被删去。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2923-31-34", "zh": "jīyati，jīyanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2924-2-6", "zh": "被动语态：jīrīyati，jīrīyanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2924-7-10", "zh": "jīyiyyati，jīyiyyanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2924-11-14", "zh": "jīratu，jīyyatu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2924-15-18", "zh": "jīreyya，jīyyeyya。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2924-19-24", "zh": "ajīrī，jīrī，jīyyī。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2924-25-28", "zh": "jīrissati，jīyyissati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2924-29-32", "zh": "ajīrissa，ajīyyissa。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2925-2-11", "zh": "mara，意为舍弃生命：替换为 mīyya，mīyyati，mīyyanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2925-12-16", "zh": "或者 mīyati，mīyanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2925-17-21", "zh": "marati，maranti，等等。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2926-2-4", "zh": "disa，意为看。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2927-2-11", "zh": "483. disa 可替换为 passa、dissa、dakkha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2928-2-12", "zh": "disa 这个词根可替换为 passa、dissa、dakkha 这几个替换形。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2928-13-23", "zh": "这里的 vā 一词表示限定性的选择，因此替换为 dissa 只用于被动语态的一切词根语尾（sabbadhātuka）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-2928-24-27", "zh": "passati，passanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2928-28-31", "zh": "dakkhati，dakkhanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2929-2-9", "zh": "被动语态中删去 ya 音：dissate，dissante。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-2929-10-13", "zh": "dissati，dissanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2929-14-17", "zh": "vipassīyati，dakkhīyati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2929-18-23", "zh": "passatu，dakkhatu，dissatu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2929-24-29", "zh": "passeyya，dakkheyya，disseyya。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2930-2-17", "zh": "在过去时（hiyyattanī）中，依“kvaci dhātu”等一条，词根的 i 音变为 a：addasā，addasa。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2930-18-20", "zh": "被动语态：adissa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2931-2-10", "zh": "同样：apassi，passi，apassiṃsu，passiṃsu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2931-11-18", "zh": "apassi，passi，apassittha，passittha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2931-19-26", "zh": "apassiṃ，passiṃ，apassimha，passimha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2931-27-34", "zh": "addasi，dasi，addasaṃsu，dasaṃsu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-2931-35-37", "zh": "被动语态：adissaṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-2931-38-41", "zh": "addakkhi，addakkhiṃsu。", "confidence": 95}
